$NetBSD$

Include the shared-library search directory in --ldflags, matching the
shipped shell configuration script. Embedding otherwise fails outside
system library directories.

Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted), installed embedding consumer failure.
Not submitted or accepted upstream.

--- Misc/python-config.in.orig
+++ Misc/python-config.in
@@ -62,6 +62,8 @@
         if opt == '--ldflags':
             if not getvar('Py_ENABLE_SHARED'):
                 libs.insert(0, '-L' + getvar('LIBPL'))
+            else:
+                libs.insert(0, '-L' + getvar('LIBDIR'))
         print(' '.join(libs))
 
     elif opt == '--extension-suffix':
